<script setup>
const props=defineProps({report:Object})
const fmt=(v,unit='')=>v==null?'未评价':`${Number(v).toFixed(1)}${unit}`
function print(){window.print()}
</script>
<template><section class="panel observation-report" v-if="report.assessment"><div class="panel-heading"><div><span class="mini-label">MOVEMENT OBSERVATION / 待指导者复核</span><h2>{{report.assessment.report_type}}</h2><p>报告 #{{report.id}} · {{report.trainee_name}} · {{String(report.started_at).replace('T',' ').slice(0,19)}}</p></div><el-button @click="print">打印 / 保存 PDF</el-button></div><p>{{report.assessment.conclusion}}</p><div class="report-facts"><div><span>采集方式</span><b>摄像头 · {{report.assessment.model.name}}</b></div><div><span>反馈方式</span><b>{{report.assessment.evaluation_mode==='TARGET'?'个体计划目标比较':'仅记录动作表现'}}</b></div><div><span>可靠观测时间 / 已采集时段</span><b>{{report.assessment.reliable_time_seconds}} / {{report.assessment.observed_time_seconds}} 秒（{{(report.assessment.reliable_time_ratio*100).toFixed(1)}}%）</b></div><div><span>未完成 / 中断尝试</span><b>{{report.assessment.incomplete_attempts}} / {{report.assessment.interrupted_attempts}}</b></div><div><span>训练前 / 后自报疼痛（0～10）</span><b>{{fmt(report.assessment.subjective.pain_before)}} / {{fmt(report.assessment.subjective.pain_after)}}</b></div><div><span>结束原因</span><b>{{report.assessment.stop_reason}}</b></div></div><el-table :data="report.assessment.by_exercise"><el-table-column prop="name" label="动作" min-width="150"/><el-table-column label="已记录 / 计划循环" min-width="150"><template #default="{row}">{{row.completed_cycles}} / {{row.planned_cycles}}</template></el-table-column><el-table-column label="峰值中位数" min-width="120"><template #default="{row}">{{fmt(row.peak_median,'°')}}</template></el-table-column><el-table-column label="循环耗时中位数" min-width="145"><template #default="{row}">{{fmt(row.duration_median,' 秒')}}</template></el-table-column><el-table-column label="计划指标满足次数" min-width="150"><template #default="{row}">{{row.task_met_cycles??'未评价'}}</template></el-table-column></el-table><div v-if="report.assessment.evaluation_mode==='TARGET'" class="report-method"><h3>本次个体目标快照</h3><p v-for="item in report.assessment.by_exercise" :key="item.code">{{item.name}}：峰值 {{item.target_min}}–{{item.target_max}}°；完整循环（含保持）{{item.cycle_min_seconds}}–{{item.cycle_max_seconds}} 秒；连续保持 {{item.hold_required_seconds}} 秒。</p></div><div class="report-method"><h3>测量方法与依据</h3><p>{{report.assessment.measurement}}</p><p>{{report.assessment.target_confirmation}}。未采集的组不计为已完成；可靠观测比例不等于模型准确率。</p><p>质量分类器：{{report.assessment.model.quality_model}}。躯干偏移作为待复核观察事件，未评价“躯干稳定达标”。</p><p v-for="source in report.assessment.references.exercises" :key="source.code"><a :href="source.source.url" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{source.source.title}} — {{source.source.section}} ↗</a></p><p>{{report.assessment.references.rules_note}}</p><details><summary>版本与工程规则</summary><p>{{report.algorithm_version}} · {{report.assessment.model.runtime}} · {{report.assessment.references.version}}</p><code class="model-hash">SHA-256: {{report.assessment.model.sha256}}</code><pre>{{JSON.stringify(report.assessment.engineering_rules,null,2)}}</pre></details><h3>解释范围</h3><ul><li v-for="limitation in report.assessment.limitations" :key="limitation">{{limitation}}</li></ul></div></section></template>
